<title>HUNGARY: Budapest BSE to delist Goldsun on July 31.</title>
<headline>Budapest BSE to delist Goldsun on July 31.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange said on Friday it would delist shares in frozen food manufacturer Goldsun Rt on July 31, with the last trading day on July 17.</p>
<p>The delisting comes as the company is in liquidation.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
